# Files never needed by `next build` / the deployed runtime — excluding them
# cuts the CLI upload from ~418MB to ~10MB (deploys respect .vercelignore).
# The app reads questions/users from Supabase at runtime; these are offline
# seeder/migration/assurance assets for local + CI use only.
#
# LEADING SLASHES ARE LOAD-BEARING: ignore patterns without a leading slash
# match at ANY depth — an unanchored `supabase/` also deleted
# src/lib/supabase/{admin,client,server}.ts and broke the first git build
# with "Module not found: @/lib/supabase/admin" (deployment dpl_GJ5GkpNB...).
/QuestionBank/
/MockExams/
/supabase/
/scripts/